ned}\n$$\n\n \n\nAlso, let $\\theta =m∠AOB$ be the angle between the vectors $a$ and $b.$ Then, we can find $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{‖a‖\\,‖b‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{1}{b}_{1}+{a}_{2}{b}_{2}+{a}_{3}{b}_{3}+{a}_{4}{b}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}+{a}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{b}_{1}^{2}+{b}_{2}^{2}+{b}_{3}^{2}+{b}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{0\\cdot (-1)+(-2)\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 2+(-3)\\cdot (-3)}{\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{14}\\cdot \\sqrt{18}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{7}\\cdot 3\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346983 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346984 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346985 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346986 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346987 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1041 "selection" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346983 13194139535386 true] [17592186346982 1110 #uuid "fbe7c084-5396-5af5-9fe0-f80301be3f5d" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346983 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{6}" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346983 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535386 true] [17592186346983 1111 #uuid "78f59ed3-7dcf-531b-ac19-e61eee91e15d" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346984 1034 "\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{7}" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346984 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535386 true] [17592186346984 1111 #uuid "e2676ba6-5fca-5e3f-baba-b7c3698b2bd6" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346985 1034 "\\frac{3}{14}" 13194139535386 true] [17592186346985 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535386 true] [17592186346985 1111 #uuid "9d3c5e98-0e51-5845-a673-594